# ProjectManager

Help teams organize and execute work.

## Entity Project: id: ID  name, status: draft | active | archived
## Entity Task: id: ID  title, done: Bool
## Capability createProject (in={'name': 'Text'} out=Project requires=[])
## Capability archiveProject (in={'project': 'Project'} out= requires=['project.archive'])
## Surface Dashboard: presents Project[], states ['loading', 'empty', 'populated', 'error']
## Flow CreateProject: Dashboard -> CreateProject -> CreateProject -> validating -> validating -> Project